After executing a search and viewing the results, users can share the current report view using the Copy URL action.

Selecting Copy URL copies a unique URL representing the current search results and applied view state to the user's clipboard. This URL can then be shared through email, Microsoft Teams, or other communication channels.

Upon successful copy, a confirmation toast message is displayed:

"URL copied to clipboard."

Recipients who access the shared URL are directed to the same report view, including the associated search query and applied filters.
